Hardware design files in this repository (schematics, PCB layout, BOM)
are intended to be released under the CERN Open Hardware Licence
Version 2 - Permissive (CERN-OHL-P-2.0).

Full license text: https://ohwr.org/cern_ohl_p_v2.txt

Using an OSHWA-recognized open hardware license is a prerequisite if
you later pursue a HardwareX submission (see docs/validation_plan.md
and the earlier discussion on publication routes) -- attach this file
alongside your actual KiCad project once it's committed.
